#VRML V2.0 utf8
# Project-authored standards fixture (oracle/standards/README.md).
# Clause numbers are those of the Web3D free copy of ISO/IEC 14772-1:1997; equality with the ISO text UNVERIFIED.
# 6.25 Inline: the file an Inline names holds children nodes at the top level (4.6.5).
DEF Child Transform {
  children [
    Shape {
      appearance Appearance { material Material { diffuseColor 0 0.5 1 } }
      geometry Box { size 1 1 1 }
    }
  ]
}
